name air-eagle-amraam
timeout 300

# THE FIRST CATALOGUE KILL. Until 2026-07-29 no catalogue row could employ a weapon at all
# (doc/modules/air/module.md A13): FBAirModule composed no fire control, FBState::FireControl was never
# written, and all three of pilot/FBPilot's employment gates therefore stayed shut on every one of the
# eighteen rows. The measurement that found it was an F-15C with four AIM-120 that designated at
# 18.64 nm, held eng_locked = 1 for 28 s down to 8.8 nm, and never pressed.
#
# THE CAST
#   eagle   hostile `f15c`, T4, four AIM-120. THE ROUND THAT DOES NOT BIND ITS SHOOTER: an active-radar
#           seeker hands over at its own activation ring, so FBSeekerHandoverS is a POSITIVE time and
#           fc_tta_s counts down to it. Its sister file air-eagle-sparrow.fbm flies the identical
#           geometry with AIM-7 and is the one-diff comparison.
#   bear    friendly `tu95`, a MOVER at 9 000 m on a straight leg — no manoeuvre, no radar, no weapon,
#           so what decides is reach, closure and the launch zone and nothing the target does.
#
# WHAT TO READ
#   telemetry.csv   fc_dlz / fc_in_zone / fc_rng_nm / fc_rtr_nm / fc_raero_nm — the LIVE launch zone,
#                   the columns whose absence was A13's symptom — and fc_tta_s > 0 (this round lets go),
#                   fc_bound = 0 after the shot
#   events.log      radar RADAR_CONTACT -> RADAR_DESIGNATE -> sms RELEASE + LAUNCH_SOLUTION ->
#                   missile SEEKER_ACTIVE mode=active -> DETONATION -> damage KILL
#
# READING RULE: exit 1 is the PASS, and the FAIL must be `bear`'s — the bomber is meant to die. An
# exit 3 (TIMEOUT) with `sms RELEASE` present but no detonation is a MISSILE result and not a
# fire-control one; an exit 3 with NO `sms RELEASE` line at all is A13 returned.

unit eagle
  team hostile
  module f15c
  spawn 46.90000 6.20000 9000 90.0 480
  set gear up
  set task intercept
  set brief_gci 90 90 9000            # the controller's call: bearing 090, 90 km, co-altitude
  set store 1 aim120
  set store 2 aim120
  set store 3 aim120
  set store 4 aim120
  set brief_master_arm arm
  wp 46.90000 7.90000 9000 480

unit bear
  team friendly
  module tu95
  spawn 46.90000 7.70000 9000 270.0 380
  wp 46.90000 5.90000 9000 380
  objective survive
